hEBI:CHEBI:15377, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:17754,ChEBI:CHEBI:57404, ChEBI:CHEBI:90233;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:21049984};PhysiologicalDirection=left-to-right; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:48301;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:21049984};BIOPHYSICOCHEMICAL PROPERTIES:Kinetic parameters:KM=110 uM for 2-arachidonoyglycerol{ECO:0000269|PubMed:22969151};KM=15 uM for 2-glyceryl-15-deoxy-Delta(12,14)-prostaglandin J2(15d-PGJ(2)-G) {ECO:0000269|PubMed:24368842};Vmax=120 nmol/min/mg enzyme toward 2-arachidonoyglycerol{ECO:0000269|PubMed:22969151};Vmax=89 nmol/min/mg enzyme toward 2-glyceryl-15-deoxy-Delta(12,14)-prostaglandin J2 (15d-PGJ(2)-G){ECO:0000269|PubMed:24368842};PATHWAY: Glycerolipid metabolism; triacylglycerol degradation.{ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:O35678}.SUBUNIT: Homodimer. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:19957260,ECO:0000269|PubMed:19962385}.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Cytoplasm, cytosol{ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:O35678}. Membrane{ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:O35678}; Peripheral membrane protein{ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:O35678}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=2;Name=1;IsoId=Q99685-1; Sequence=Displayed;Name=2;IsoId=Q99685-2; Sequence=VSP_045138, VSP_045139;TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Detected in adipose tissue, lung, liver,kidney, brain and heart. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:11470505}.MISCELLANEOUS: Short-term inhibition causes analgesia, while long-term inhibition causes tolerance to endocannabinoids acting onbrain cannabinoid receptor CNR1, and a reduction in braincannabinoid receptor CNR1 activity. {ECO:0000250}.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the AB hydrolase superfamily.Monoacylglycerol lipase family. {ECO:0000305}.SEQUENCE CAUTION:Sequence=AAB39616.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAH00551.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAH06230.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=BAG37910.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=CAG33116.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=EAW79330.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=EAW79331.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally shortened.; Evidence={ECO:0000305}; COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
